# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (30 steps, 5 chapters) =============================================
info title=The Trade Wind Archipelago
info author=Custom Islands
info description=Dozens of palm islets on one vast reef, three little harbour towns, and the course of the Trade Wind Regatta laid out in buoys round them all. The fleet never sailed this year. Sign on, fire the start cannon, and sail the course in your own raft - buoy by buoy, town by town - for the Trade Wind Trophy.
island on.arrive=message||Turquoise water to the horizon, palm islets scattered over it like a handful of seeds - and off the biggest one, a committee boat with flags on its lines and a cannon on its deck.

story racenumber|Race number|quest:Tangaroa_Tape|Your race number for the Trade Wind Regatta, painted on a board: 17.
story pennant|Harbour pennant|Placeable_Flag_05|A harbour town's pennant, given to every crew that calls in during the race.
story leaderflag|The leader's flag|Placeable_Flag_07|Last year's winner's racing flag, from her wreck at buoy six.
story entryslip|Stamped entry|quest:Utopia_DettoCode|The committee's stamp on your entry: COURSE COMPLETED.

note notice The regatta notice | THE TRADE WIND REGATTA\n\nSign on in the register at the regatta office for your race number.\nThe course: from the start off Port Alize, round EIGHT buoys in order - each one shows you the next - and back to the committee boat.\nCall at the three harbours on the way - Port Alize, Windward Cay, Leeward Key - for a pennant each.\nBuoy six is the wreck of last year's winner. Bring back her flag.\nNumber, three pennants and the flag to the committee; the trophy is in the clubhouse.\n\n(scrawled:) STORM - FLEET SCATTERED - RACE POSTPONED. Cannon's still loaded if anyone fancies it.
note tillerbox Harbourmaster's tiller box | The tiller box of the harbourmaster's skiff, on the harbour floor: Port Alize's pennant for the race, still dry in its oilcloth.
loot tillerbox story:pennant*1;Rope*2
prop tillerbox loot.refill=0
note ledger The committee's ledger | REGATTA COMMITTEE - LEDGER\n\nEntries this year: 23. Starters: 0. (The storm.)\nTo finish: your race number, the three harbour pennants and the leader's flag into the entries box. The committee's stamp is the key to the trophy room.\nThe winner rings the bell on the clubhouse tower. It's tradition.
note fishwife The fishwife's complaint | (pinned to the fish market's post)\n\nRATS in my back room, eating the regatta's fish. Whoever clears them gets Windward's pennant - it's in my box, and I'm not going in there.\n- Mags
note fishwifebox Windward Cay's pennant box | The fishwife's box: Windward Cay's pennant, smelling of fish, and a smoked mackerel for the road.
loot fishwifebox story:pennant*1;Cooked_Mackerel*2
prop fishwifebox loot.refill=0
prop fishwifebox if.open=quest|12
prop fishwifebox else.open=message||Mags's box, tied shut with net twine: FOR WHOEVER CLEARS THE RATS.
note goatherd The goatherd's plea | (on the pen's gate)\n\nThe storm knocked the pen down and my three goats are all over the key - one's right up on the hilltop. Net launcher in the basket.\nBring them home and you'll have Leeward's pennant.\n- Tavi
note netbasket Goatherd's basket | Tavi's basket: the net launcher, its canisters, a goat bell.
loot netbasket NetGun*1;NetCanister*6
prop netbasket loot.refill=0
note goatherdbox Leeward Key's pennant box | The goatherd's box: Leeward Key's pennant, braided with goat hair, and fresh milk in a jar.
loot goatherdbox story:pennant*1;Bucket_Milk*1
prop goatherdbox loot.refill=0
prop goatherdbox if.open=quest|20
prop goatherdbox else.open=message||Tavi's box. FOR WHOEVER BRINGS MY GOATS HOME.
note engraving The trophy's engraving | (fresh letters on the trophy's plinth, as if they had always been there)\n\nTHE TRADE WIND TROPHY\nwon by crew number 17,\nthe only starter of the storm year,\nwho sailed it alone.
note trophy The Trade Wind Trophy | The Trade Wind Trophy's chest: the prize purse of a whole regatta, the plans for the race committee's zipline from the clubhouse to the quay, a captain's hat, a sailor's hat, and the trophy itself - a silver fish on a stand.
loot trophy TradeToken*25;Blueprint_ZiplineTool*1;Hat_Captain*1;Hat_Sailor*1;Placeable_TrophyBoard_Large*1;TitaniumIngot*3
prop trophy loot.refill=0
prop trophy if.open=has|story:entryslip|1
prop trophy else.open=message||The trophy room's chest. The committee's stamp opens it.
note fruitbox Fruit stall box | A fruit stall's box: bananas and coconuts.
loot fruitbox Banana*3;Coconut*2;Mango*2
prop fruitbox loot.refill=0
note committeebox Committee boat box | A box on the committee boat's deck: spare flags, rope, a starter's whistle.
loot committeebox Rope*3;Plastic*2;Plank*4
prop committeebox loot.refill=0
note caybarrel Windward barrel | A barrel on Windward's boardwalk: salt fish and net floats.
loot caybarrel Cooked_Herring*3;Plastic*2;Rope*1
prop caybarrel loot.refill=0
note wreckcrate Wreck's crate | A crate by the leader's wreck: her spares.
loot wreckcrate MetalOre*2;Scrap*3;Bolt*2
prop wreckcrate loot.refill=0
note islebox1 Islet box | A box on a little islet, left for passing crews: water and fruit.
loot islebox1 PlasticBottle_Water*2;Mango*2
prop islebox1 loot.refill=0
note islebox2 Islet box | A box on a little islet: rope and planks for repairs.
loot islebox2 Rope*3;Plank*4
prop islebox2 loot.refill=0
note islebox3 Islet box | A box on a little islet: nails and a tin of meat.
loot islebox3 Nail*8;Cooked_GenericMeat*1
prop islebox3 loot.refill=0

prop register obj.name=register
prop register beh.use=Sign on in the regatta register
prop register if.use=!signal|signed
prop register on.use=message||You sign the register. The office clerk's last stamp is still inked: your number is 17.\nsignal||signed\ngive||story:racenumber*1\nsound||event:/char/logbook_flip
prop register else.use=message||You're signed on: number 17.
prop startcannon obj.name=startcannon
prop startcannon beh.use=Fire the start cannon
prop startcannon if.use=has|story:racenumber|1\n!signal|started
prop startcannon on.use=message||BOOM - the start cannon's smoke rolls over the harbour. The regatta is on! Out to the north-east, a flag goes up on the first buoy.\nsignal||started\nshow|buoy1\nshow|buoy1mark\nsound||event:/weapons/dynamite/explode
prop startcannon else.use=message||The start cannon. Sign on in the register first - or the race has started already.
prop buoy1 obj.name=buoy1
prop buoy1 beh.hidden=1
prop buoy1 zone.id=buoy1
prop buoy1 zone.radius=9
prop buoy1 zone.repeat=never
prop buoy1 zone.message=Buoy one rounded! A flag goes up to the north-east: buoy two.
prop buoy1 on.enter=show|buoy2\nshow|buoy2mark\nsound||event:/crafting/horns/air
prop buoy1mark obj.name=buoy1mark
prop buoy1mark beh.hidden=1
prop buoy1mark beh.bob=0.3
prop buoy2 obj.name=buoy2
prop buoy2 beh.hidden=1
prop buoy2 zone.id=buoy2
prop buoy2 zone.radius=9
prop buoy2 zone.repeat=never
prop buoy2 zone.message=Buoy two rounded! The next flag is off Windward Cay.
