quest title=The Trade Wind Regatta
quest intro=A regatta course laid round a whole archipelago, the fleet scattered by a storm. The regatta notice is by the office in Port Alize.
# Chapter 1 - the start (Port Alize)
step reach|portalize|1|Tie up on the quay at Port Alize
step read|The regatta notice|1|Read the regatta notice by the office
step collect|story:racenumber|1|Sign on in the register for your race number
step reach|harbourfloor|1|Dive to the harbourmaster's sunk skiff in the harbour
step collect|story:pennant|1|Take Port Alize's pennant from the skiff's tiller box
step reach|startline|1|Sail out to the committee boat and fire the start cannon
# Chapter 2 - the windward leg
step reach|buoy1|1|Round buoy one
step reach|buoy2|1|Round buoy two
step reach|buoy3|1|Round buoy three off Windward Cay
step reach|windwardcay|1|Call in at Windward Cay
step read|The fishwife's complaint|1|Read the fishwife's complaint at the fish market
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the rats out of the fish market's back room
step collect|story:pennant|2|Take Windward Cay's pennant from the fishwife's box
# Chapter 3 - the reef leg
step reach|buoy4|1|Round buoy four at the reef passage's mouth
step reach|buoy5|1|Thread the passage and round buoy five
step reach|wreckmark|1|Round buoy six - the sunken leader's wreck
step collect|story:leaderflag|1|Dive to the wreck and take the leader's flag
step reach|leewardkey|1|Call in at Leeward Key
# Chapter 4 - Leeward Key
step read|The goatherd's plea|1|Read the goatherd's plea on the pen gate
step catch|Goat|3|Net the goatherd's three goats
step collect|story:pennant|3|Take Leeward Key's pennant from the goatherd's box
step reach|buoy7|1|Round buoy seven
# Chapter 5 - the run home
step reach|buoy8|1|Round buoy eight
step reach|finish|1|Cross the finish line at the committee boat
step read|The committee's ledger|1|Read the committee's ledger
step collect|story:entryslip|1|Hand in your number, the three pennants and the leader's flag
step reach|clubhouse|1|Climb to the regatta clubhouse on the hill
step reach|clubtower|1|Climb the bell tower
step read|The trophy's engraving|1|Ring the winner's bell and read the trophy's engraving
step open|The Trade Wind Trophy|1|Open the Trade Wind Trophy
quest done=Crew 17, the only starter of the storm year, sailed the whole Trade Wind course alone - and the trophy says so, in silver.
quest reward=Rope*6;Plank*10;Cooked_Herring*4

save The Trade Wind Archipelago
